     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello,<div><br><div>I will post in this thread my apps which are useless except for understanding and/or explaining some basic Shiny functioning. </div></div><div><br></div><div>Here is the first one; it illustrates <span style=\"background-color:rgb(248,248,248);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;white-space:nowrap\">isolate()</span> as well as <span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;white-space:nowrap;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">actionButton()</span>: <a href=\"http://glimmer.rstudio.com/stla/Isolate_example1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://glimmer.rstudio.com/stla/Isolate_example1/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792406298327000&amp;usg=AOvVaw38328L6I1V6U4PwihHOqbT\">http://glimmer.rstudio.com/stla/Isolate_example1/</a></div><div><br></div><div>The <span style=\"background-color:rgb(248,248,248);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap\">showfiles()</span> function is defined in <span style=\"background-color:rgb(248,248,248);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap\">global.R</span>, which contains nothing else :</div><div><div style=\"margin-top:20px;margin-bottom:20px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Helvetica,arial,freesans,clean,sans-serif;line-height:18px\"><div style=\"padding:3px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238);border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;margin-left:60px;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\"><div style=\"min-height:32px;border:1px solid rgb(202,202,202);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><div><div style=\"font-size:12px;background-color:rgb(251,251,251)\"><div><div style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;overflow:auto;word-wrap:break-word;padding:10px;width:732px;box-sizing:border-box\"><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;margin-top:15px;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border:1px solid rgb(221,221,221);line-height:19px;overflow:auto;padding:6px 10px;border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;border-style:none;background-color:transparent;border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;word-wrap:normal\">library(shinyAce)\r\nshowfiles &lt;- function(){\r\n  list(\r\n    aceEditor(&quot;server&quot;, \r\n              value = paste(readLines(&quot;server.R&quot;), collapse=&quot;\\n&quot;),\r\n              mode=&quot;r&quot;, theme=&quot;cobalt&quot;, height=&quot;260px&quot;, \r\n              readOnly=TRUE),\r\n    aceEditor(&quot;ui&quot;, \r\n              value = paste(readLines(&quot;ui.R&quot;), collapse=&quot;\\n&quot;),\r\n              mode=&quot;r&quot;, theme=&quot;cobalt&quot;, height=&quot;400px&quot;, \r\n              readOnly=TRUE)\r\n    )\r\n}\r\n</code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Helvetica,arial,freesans,clean,sans-serif;line-height:18px\"><div style=\"padding-left:60px;color:rgb(102,102,102)\"><br></div></div></div><div></div></div>"
